1
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:15,061
Before asking, you can see what you have
left. Nobody has to ask the office that

2
00:00:15,061 --> 00:00:15,756
question.

3
00:00:16,208 --> 00:00:20,155
Pick the days on the calendar,
the way you would point at them.

4
00:00:20,606 --> 00:00:25,018
Say what kind it is, and add a
line if it helps whoever answers.

5
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:30,021
Send it. That is the
whole of it from this side.

6
00:00:30,472 --> 00:00:35,813
At the desk it arrives among everything
else that needs a decision this week.

7
00:00:36,265 --> 00:00:40,537
With what it would leave behind
it, so the answer is not a guess.

8
00:00:40,987 --> 00:00:47,535
Answered, and kept: who
asked, who agreed, and when.

9
00:00:50,441 --> 00:00:54,249
Next: getting your team into
the product in the first place.

